{"id": "JAH-MARSLAY-000001", "slug": "mars-operation-layouts", "title": "Mars Operation Layout — Mars Habitat Oul Grid (Speculative)", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "layout plan record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Signature edition. SPECULATIVE Signature-concept — a Mars operations layout concept, not a real mission plan. The Mars Habitat Oul Grid divides a habitat site into pressurized and unpressurized oul cells: A-row for habitat modules, B-row for power and life support, C-row for workshops and labs, D-row for landing and logistics. Each oul carries its needs list — power draw, airlock cycles, crew hours. Layout rule: no crew crosses from a dusty D-row oul to an A-row oul without passing through the de-dusting lock. A concept for study and imagination.", "capabilities": ["Grid the habitat into oul rows", "Assign modules to A-row ouls", "Place power in B-row", "Route dust through de-dusting locks", "Write needs lists per oul"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Mars oul power budget checker (speculative)", "code": "const t=C.ouls.reduce((a,o)=>a+o.kw,0);assert(t===C.expected&&t<=C.capacity_kw,'budget');J({total_kw:t,within_capacity:t<=C.capacity_kw});", "verified_output": "{\"total_kw\":60,\"within_capacity\":true}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Mars Layout Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Mars Landing Zone Layout (Speculative)", "Mars Greenhouse Oul Row (Speculative)"], "sibling_edition": "mars-operation-layouts-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-MARSLAY-000002", "slug": "mars-operation-layouts", "title": "Mars Operation Layout — Mars Landing Zone Layout (Speculative)", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "layout plan record", "ladder_rank": 2, "body": "Signature edition. SPECULATIVE Signature-concept. The landing zone sits one kilometer upwind of the habitat ouls: pad ouls for cargo landers, a fuel depot oul, and a rover park. Blast ejecta travels far in thin air, so the pad ouls are bermed and the approach corridor stays clear of all other ouls. Needs list: berm material, pad surfacing, fuel storage, rover charging. A concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Site pads one kilometer upwind", "Berm the pad ouls", "Keep the approach corridor clear", "Build the depot needs list", "Plan rover charging"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Mars pad separation checker (speculative)", "code": "const ok=C.distance_km>=C.min_km;assert(ok===C.expected_ok,'separation');J({separation_ok:ok});", "verified_output": "{\"separation_ok\":true}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Mars Layout Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Mars Habitat Oul Grid (Speculative)", "Mars Greenhouse Oul Row (Speculative)"], "sibling_edition": "mars-operation-layouts-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-MARSLAY-000003", "slug": "mars-operation-layouts", "title": "Mars Operation Layout — Mars Greenhouse Oul Row (Speculative)", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "layout plan record", "ladder_rank": 4, "body": "Signature edition. SPECULATIVE Signature-concept. The greenhouse row grows food in stacked oul cells under transparent pressure shells: leafy greens in A, fruiting crops in B, algae bioreactors in C. Each oul's needs list tracks water, light hours, and nutrient mix. Layout rule: the algae ouls sit lowest, so gravity feeds nutrients downhill to the crop ouls. A concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Stack greenhouse ouls by crop", "Track water per oul", "Schedule light hours", "Place algae ouls lowest", "Write the nutrient needs list"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Mars crop water budget (speculative)", "code": "const total=C.ouls.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);const makeup=total*(1-C.recycle_pct/100);assert(Math.abs(makeup-C.expected_makeup)<0.01,'makeup');J({daily_makeup_liters:Math.round(makeup*100)/100});", "verified_output": "{\"daily_makeup_liters\":10}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Mars Layout Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Mars Habitat Oul Grid (Speculative)", "Mars Landing Zone Layout (Speculative)"], "sibling_edition": "mars-operation-layouts